{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 1421,
	"Name": "Better Horses",
	"Author": "SerialDollface",
	"Description": "[center][size=4][i][b][/b][/i][/size][/center][center][size=4][i][b]Disclaimer:\n<br />[/b][/i][/size][i]Please do not download my mods from any place other than\u00A0[/i][url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/35985545/?tb=mods&amp;pUp=1#]NexusMods[/url][i]![/i]\n<br />[url=http://www.stardewvalleymods.net/]WWW.STARDEWVALLEYMODS.NET\u00A0[/url][i]STEALS mods and uploads them on their website without permission![/i]\n<br />[i]Do not download any mods there! If you see my mods anywhere other than Nexus, please link me to the site asap. Thank you![/i]\n<br />[i]\uFEFF\n<br />[/i]\n<br />[b][u][size=5][i]About This Mod[/i]\n<br />\n<br />[/size][/u][/b][size=3][i]This mod is simply a retexture and minor modification to Minakie's\u00A0[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/759/?]Real Life H[/url][url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/759/?]orses[/url]. Minakie did a fantastic job combining\u00A0Avalitor's\u00A0[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/261/]Redesigned Horse Running Animation[/url]\u00A0and Kitana Coldfire's\u00A0[url=http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/bigger-draft-horse-model-clydesdale-skin.112941/]Bigger Draft Horse Model[/url], I just wanted to add more colors and options to the mix!\n<br />\n<br />I have made seven more breeds and colors that were not included in Minakie's original mod, one of which includes Zhuria's\u00A0[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1]Norwegian Fjord Horse[/url], as that was the replacer that inspired me to keep making more and to upload them all here!\n<br />\n<br />Every new breed and color comes with a bareback and a saddled version with my own custom saddle. Every download will include a picture of the horse it was inspired from, a preview of the in-game horse sprite, the horse.xnb file and an installation Instructions.txt. There are also optional files containing all the same breeds with all the same features, only difference is the East/West running animation no longer blinks if you found that distracting with the original files.\n<br />[/i][/size]\n<br />[size=3][i]Of course, should any of the aforementioned mod makers have an issue with this upload, I will comply with their requests to change or remove my work.\n<br />\n<br />[i]Thank you for checking out my mod and for any and all feedback![/i][/i][/size][size=3][i]\n<br />[/i][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=5][b][u]Planned Updates[/u][/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[i][size=3]I am open to the idea of taking on requests, so if you have a breed that you want to see here, let me know and I'll see what I can do![/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][u]Next Update:[/u][/b]\n<br />[size=3]Progress for this mod is currently postponed - \n<br />Check the comments for more details.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[u]Future updates will include:[/u][/i][size=2][i]\n<br />Three Winter Horses\n<br />Three New Horse Breeds\n<br />[i]Custom Reins\n<br />Three Recolor Requests\n<br />Three Animated Horses\n<br />[/i][i][i]Bridal Versions[/i][/i]\n<br />Color Variants of Current Breeds\n<br />[/i][/size][size=3][i]\n<br />\n<br />[b][u][size=5]Changelog\n<br />\n<br />[/size][/u][/b][size=3][i][u]9/5/17[/u]\u00A0\u00A0No Blink (NB) versions added.\n<br />[u]9/8/17[/u]\u00A0No Blink (NB) versions fixed.\n<br />[u]10/8/17[/u]\u00A0Shadowmere and NB Shadowmere added.\n<br />[/i][/size][u]10/28/17[/u]\u00A0Nightmare and NB Nightmare added.\n<br />[u]11/19/17[/u]\u00A0French Saddle and NB French Saddle added.\n<br />[/i][/size][i][size=3][u]11/29/17[/u]\u00A0Mustang and NB Mustang added.\n<br />[u]12/02/17[/u]\u00A0Clydesdale and NB Clydesdale added.\n<br />[/size][/i][size=3][i][u]12/17/17[/u]\u00A0Camarillo White and NB Camarillo White added.[/i][/size][/center]",
